# dsh-desktop

<p align="center">
  <b>Native Windows desktop launcher for DeepSeek Harness (<code>@deepseek-ai/dsh</code>)</b><br>
  One shortcut = run <code>dsh web --no-open</code> in a chosen directory, parse this process's token, open a maximized Edge app window, and keep it in the tray until you quit from the tray menu.
